$ Deep-water wind-wave growth with the semi-implicit DIA per sweep
$
$ Identical to quad_dia2 apart from QUADRUPLET 1, so the two decks isolate the
$ semi-implicit variant of SWSNL1 against the explicit SWSNL2 of the default.
$ This is the only deck in the repository that reaches SWSNL1; without it the
$ bounds-checked CI build has nothing to check that routine against.
$
$ ALFA=0.01 keeps the deck in the regime where the change-based criterion
$ stops too early: it reports convergence after 40 iterations at Hs 1.410 m
$ at 25 km, while the balance of the same deck is at 1.933 m (residual 1e-8
$ when it is made to run 100 iterations without ALFA; its own criterion
$ stops it after 28 iterations at 1.919 m). The reference output of this
$ deck therefore pins the code path, not a converged wave height. These
$ numbers are for the fork's semi-implicit DIA (BF-62); with QUADRUPLET 1
$ UPSTREAM the run reports convergence at 1.403 m and only reaches 1.923 m
$ after about 1500 iterations with ALFA=0.01.
$
$ With the upstream DIA and without ALFA the run converges in 28 iterations.
$ Upstream 41.51 does not: after 1000 iterations it is at 80% of its
$ criterion. With breaking off, an undefined KTETA switches its action
$ limiter off everywhere (BF-16).
$ (Measured on 10 November 2026 with scripts/stop_check.py.)
PROJECT 'QUADDIA1' '001'
SET CARTESIAN
MODE STATIONARY ONEDIMENSIONAL
COORDINATES CARTESIAN

CGRID REGULAR 0.0 0.0 0.0 100000.0 0.0 40 0 &
      CIRCLE 36 0.04 1.0 34
INPGRID BOTTOM REGULAR 0.0 0.0 0.0 1 0 100000.0 1.0
READINP BOTTOM 1.0 'bottom.bot' 1 0 FREE

WIND 15.0 0.0
BOUND SHAPESPEC JONSWAP 3.3 PEAK DSPR DEGREES
BOUNDSPEC SIDE WEST CONSTANT PAR 0.05 2.0 0.0 20.0

GEN3 WESTH
QUADRUPLET 1
OFF BREAKING

POINTS 'GAUGES' 0.0 0.0 25000.0 0.0 50000.0 0.0 &
         75000.0 0.0 100000.0 0.0
TABLE 'GAUGES' HEADER 'quad_dia1.tbl' XP DEPTH HSIGN TM01 RTP REDTRIAD REDQUAD
SPECOUT 'GAUGES' SPEC1D ABS 'quad_dia1.spc'
TEST 1 0 POINTS XY 50000.0 0.0 S1D 'quad_dia1_sources.spc'

NUMERIC STOPC STAT MXITST=100 ALFA=0.01

COMPUTE
STOP
